{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t國家統計局公布，1-9月全國規模以上工業企業實現利潤總額逾6.03萬億元人民幣，按可比口徑計算按年增長15.5%；單計9月利潤按年增長14.4%，增速創3個月新高。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n數據顯示，1-9月規模以上工業企業實現營業收入106.21萬億元，按年增長6.6%；營業收入利潤率5.68%，按年提高0.44個百分點。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n截至9月底，工業企業資產負債率58.6%，按年上升0.4個百分點。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李意琴\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:50.925966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:15:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:59:07.532810+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:33.075666+00:00","content_hash":"b43143496d404b538d976dde8fde4cbf2941869e7ec3f4c40da01635826ce5e3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}